- Engine environment: qwen-asr (Apache-2.0), faster-whisper (MIT), CTranslate2 (MIT), PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause),
  soundfile (BSD-3-Clause), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), onnxruntime (MIT; Silero VAD model bundled with faster-whisper, MIT).
- FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1+ / GPL depending on the build) — called as an external program.
- yt-dlp (Unlicense) — called as an external program, only when an address (URL) is given.
- Optional: DiariZen (code MIT, model weights CC BY-NC 4.0 — non-commercial), pyannote.audio (MIT) — speaker diarization,
  installed and run separately; its path is set in stt/models.json.
- Optional: pytest (MIT), Playwright (Apache-2.0) for tests and the browser check.

Models downloaded separately (not included): Qwen3-ASR (Apache-2.0), Whisper large-v3-turbo (MIT) via the
faster-whisper conversion (mobiuslabsgmbh/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo).

